*List and Bytes Operators* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

ChipLang's engine redefines arithmetic operators for lists and bytes:

''+'' - Concatenate two lists or two bytes (see ''append(container, value)'')
''*'' - Repeat list or bytes by number
''/'' - Access element at index (see ''get(container, index)'')
''-'' - Remove element at index

Indicies are 0-based.
